{"id":"n93369-1-8","stage":5,"title":"구직자 · 求职者","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93369-1-8-1","ko":"오늘 강당에서 무슨 행사가 있나 봐.","zh":"看来今天礼堂里有什么活动啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"강당에서","meaning":"礼堂，大礼堂","explanation":"강당：礼堂，大礼堂；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"강당","audio":"/audio/a838d7e7db3f2cdccbb1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85864","senseId":"1","lemma":"강당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강당에서","audio":"/audio/835b783157e9b02c1bad.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"행사가","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행사가","audio":"/audio/8e4af404f554aa1a2cc1.mp3"}},{"text":"있나","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나","audio":"/audio/54242f507cd667676232.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","le